WEBVTT

00:42.083 --> 00:46.963
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

00:54.095 --> 00:55.722
Sir?

01:11.029 --> 01:12.197
Hello--

01:24.793 --> 01:26.169
It keeps disconnecting.

01:27.087 --> 01:28.004
Wait for now.

01:33.134 --> 01:37.138
OFFICE BUILDING B

01:50.985 --> 01:51.820
What?

01:52.403 --> 01:53.238
What was that?

01:53.822 --> 01:55.240
What? What's wrong?

01:56.116 --> 01:59.077
- I think someone's here.
- Who? No one would come here.

02:04.749 --> 02:06.167
See? I told you.

02:08.086 --> 02:08.920
It's connected.

02:10.547 --> 02:11.798
I'll stop it now.

02:13.049 --> 02:14.050
Good job.

02:14.843 --> 02:17.220
From now on, wait on all fours like that.

02:18.805 --> 02:19.806
Who knows?

02:20.765 --> 02:23.184
I might even throw you a bone.

02:26.646 --> 02:27.480
What?

02:28.690 --> 02:30.024
What did you say, bastard?

02:30.108 --> 02:33.111
What are you trying to do?
I really won't stand for this.

02:33.194 --> 02:35.113
Did someone order pizza?

02:35.196 --> 02:36.573
But why is it so heavy?

02:37.157 --> 02:38.366
Don't regret this later.

02:39.033 --> 02:39.868
Don't open it!

02:51.254 --> 02:52.255
Sir?

02:56.050 --> 02:56.885
Sir.

03:01.347 --> 03:02.348
Sir?

03:03.808 --> 03:04.934
Sir!

03:08.146 --> 03:09.147
Sir?

03:10.315 --> 03:11.482
Are you okay?

03:15.945 --> 03:17.155
You shouldn't get up.

03:21.784 --> 03:23.077
What happened?

03:23.161 --> 03:25.705
I brought you to Dr. Kim's hospital.

03:25.788 --> 03:26.998
What about the others?

03:27.081 --> 03:30.627
They're being treated in the ER.
Thankfully, no one was seriously injured.

03:38.217 --> 03:39.218
Was it an explosion?

03:39.802 --> 03:40.678
Yes.

03:40.762 --> 03:42.847
The police are analyzing the footage now.

03:42.931 --> 03:44.390
But you need to see something.

03:45.725 --> 03:47.143
It's from the security room.

03:47.769 --> 03:48.937
I think it's him.

04:18.258 --> 04:22.220
At 10:49 p.m.,
Hong Hee-joo is safely at home.

04:31.980 --> 04:34.649
What will you do?
The police don't know you're involved.

04:34.732 --> 04:37.068
So? Should I sit back and do nothing?

04:37.777 --> 04:41.364
He broke into my personal office
and bombed my team.

04:41.447 --> 04:43.366
He's trying to challenge me!

04:43.449 --> 04:44.951
But if you get involved now,

04:45.702 --> 04:47.203
the reporters will catch wind.

04:47.287 --> 04:48.746
Maybe this is what he wants.

04:49.414 --> 04:51.374
A situation where I can't step forward.

04:51.874 --> 04:52.709
But…

04:54.085 --> 04:55.336
I have to respond.

04:57.505 --> 05:01.509
There are plenty of ways to screw him over
without revealing myself.

05:03.261 --> 05:05.138
EPISODE 3

05:06.639 --> 05:08.891
The perpetrator,
who had been making threats,

05:08.975 --> 05:11.352
set fire
to the victim's office last night.

05:11.436 --> 05:13.021
- The fire department…
- A fire?

05:13.104 --> 05:14.856
…put out the fire in 20 minutes.

05:15.815 --> 05:17.150
When did I do that?

05:17.233 --> 05:21.321
There could've been casualties,
but quick action averted disaster.

05:22.196 --> 05:25.658
The police, fire department, and forensics
are conducting an investigation.

05:26.534 --> 05:29.620
They'll form a dedicated team
to look into the incident.

05:29.704 --> 05:31.372
This was Jang Seok-hyeon with HBC.

05:44.052 --> 05:44.886
Lately,

05:45.887 --> 05:47.430
nothing makes sense.

05:49.640 --> 05:51.976
There can't be a Hong Hee-joo
I don't know about.

05:56.105 --> 05:57.523
I need to find out

05:58.524 --> 05:59.650
which one is the real one.

06:01.569 --> 06:02.904
Right now,

06:03.738 --> 06:04.989
you're my only lead.

06:06.407 --> 06:07.450
So cooperate.

06:28.262 --> 06:29.263
Are you hurt?

06:30.807 --> 06:35.394
Some crazy man
delivered a bomb to my personal office.

06:41.609 --> 06:43.444
- Was it the kidnapper?
- Yeah.

06:45.404 --> 06:48.074
From now on, I'll be asking the questions.

06:49.200 --> 06:52.453
You said you didn't know
who he was, right?

06:54.747 --> 06:56.165
Any guesses on who it is?

06:59.710 --> 07:00.711
You don't know?

07:04.173 --> 07:05.007
But why…

07:07.093 --> 07:08.261
does it seem like…

07:10.888 --> 07:12.557
he knows you so well?

07:20.231 --> 07:21.524
Even your private…

07:21.607 --> 07:24.026
What do I say if he asks me
about the picture?

07:24.777 --> 07:26.571
…and intimate stories.

07:26.654 --> 07:29.282
Can things get more complicated from here?

07:42.503 --> 07:43.463
What are you doing?

07:50.136 --> 07:51.679
And what are you doing?

07:55.975 --> 08:00.521
What does he know about me?
And what are you trying to check?

08:06.068 --> 08:09.322
He kidnapped me,
and you got hurt because of him.

08:09.405 --> 08:11.324
So, what are we doing right now?

08:16.579 --> 08:17.830
So…

08:19.332 --> 08:21.584
you don't know what I'm trying to do

08:22.668 --> 08:24.962
or what I'm trying to see, right?

08:32.803 --> 08:34.514
PARK DO-JAE

08:50.488 --> 08:53.074
I apologize if you were offended.

08:57.787 --> 08:58.788
How did it go?

09:05.586 --> 09:06.879
I managed to get away with it.

09:08.923 --> 09:10.091
A serial arsonist?

09:11.592 --> 09:12.426
Yes.

09:13.094 --> 09:16.556
In the last six months, there have been
multiple cases in the area.

09:16.639 --> 09:19.267
The police are investigating this
as part of it.

09:21.477 --> 09:23.062
Serial arson…

09:24.438 --> 09:26.607
Either he's lucky or he planned this.

09:27.191 --> 09:29.068
- It's one or the other.
- What?

09:30.653 --> 09:33.656
He got lucky
without knowing about the serial arson,

09:34.198 --> 09:36.576
or he intended
to ride the arsonist's coattails.

09:37.451 --> 09:38.536
However,

09:38.619 --> 09:40.079
it was probably intentional.

09:41.289 --> 09:43.583
We'll investigate independently.

09:44.166 --> 09:45.793
And there's something strange.

09:45.876 --> 09:46.711
What is it?

09:47.670 --> 09:49.922
The explosion happened during the call.

09:50.590 --> 09:52.258
Do you think there's an accomplice?

09:53.467 --> 09:54.927
That seems possible.

09:55.595 --> 09:57.847
Yes, it's more than possible.

09:58.389 --> 10:00.808
The fact that he knows so much about me

10:01.684 --> 10:03.686
suggests that he's very close.

10:04.895 --> 10:07.648
The police are requesting
the threat recording. What shall I do?

10:07.732 --> 10:09.066
It must not be leaked.

10:09.692 --> 10:12.403
What I pieced together earlier
was for broadcasting purposes.

10:13.029 --> 10:14.447
Tell them that's everything.

10:14.905 --> 10:17.283
Sa-eon edited it and handed it over?

10:25.916 --> 10:28.336
Bring your phone.
I have to check something.

10:29.003 --> 10:31.922
I need to check for any signs of hacking.

10:46.562 --> 10:48.356
How could you be so careless?

10:51.942 --> 10:53.736
You earn a living with your hands.

11:01.702 --> 11:02.662
It won't take long.

11:03.621 --> 11:04.914
Are you going to the center?

11:07.625 --> 11:08.709
Stay at home.

11:09.794 --> 11:11.295
I have to leave after I shower.

11:13.714 --> 11:14.965
Hacking? Why?

11:18.886 --> 11:19.970
Because of the photo?

11:32.108 --> 11:33.692
MOVE TO TRASH

11:35.653 --> 11:37.196
POWER OFF

12:03.013 --> 12:05.516
The candidate registration is coming up.

12:05.599 --> 12:08.811
You've never dropped out
of first place in the polls.

12:08.894 --> 12:10.521
You can continue like this.

12:10.604 --> 12:12.565
It's all thanks to you.

12:14.900 --> 12:18.237
Our campaign's PR line for the election
is very solid.

12:18.320 --> 12:19.155
I like it.

12:20.114 --> 12:22.199
Thank you for getting me
such talented people.

12:22.283 --> 12:23.826
Don't mention it.

12:24.785 --> 12:27.663
But don't you actually keep

12:28.164 --> 12:30.458
the most talented one close at hand?

12:31.417 --> 12:32.376
My son-in-law.

12:33.127 --> 12:34.795
Spokesperson Paik.

12:35.463 --> 12:39.967
I wonder how you will use him
after you keep him hidden away.

12:40.050 --> 12:41.594
I'm quite curious.

12:50.478 --> 12:54.023
This reminds me of when I used
to go hunting with Chairman Paik.

12:54.940 --> 12:58.611
He possessed
remarkable instinctive abilities.

12:58.694 --> 13:01.614
I could never match
my father's athletic abilities.

13:03.574 --> 13:06.202
He was decisive and made quick judgments.

13:07.203 --> 13:10.956
It seems Sa-eon inherited those qualities.

13:25.179 --> 13:26.722
This is so boring.

13:27.431 --> 13:30.559
We should tell them not to invite us
unless they're golfing.

13:30.643 --> 13:31.477
Don't you agree?

13:36.565 --> 13:38.317
Am I the only one who's bored?

13:40.236 --> 13:41.779
What's so interesting?

13:41.862 --> 13:43.489
That's hot!

13:43.572 --> 13:45.366
- What's wrong, honey?
- What happened?

13:45.449 --> 13:46.784
That's hot! I need ice!

13:46.867 --> 13:48.536
- Ice!
- Get some ice!

13:48.619 --> 13:49.620
I'll get the ice.

13:50.162 --> 13:51.664
Did you make a mistake?

13:53.040 --> 13:53.958
A mistake?

13:54.542 --> 13:58.837
Would looking at someone else's phone
be accidental or intentional?

13:59.421 --> 14:00.381
Come on.

14:03.759 --> 14:04.593
Mr. Hong.

14:05.177 --> 14:07.054
I'm sorry, but I'll get going.

14:07.137 --> 14:09.014
I'm a bit sensitive to noise.

14:11.892 --> 14:13.143
Ice. Bring it here.

14:13.936 --> 14:15.104
Here you go.

14:15.187 --> 14:17.022
You should sit down.

14:17.106 --> 14:19.316
What do we do about this?

14:19.400 --> 14:20.526
Let's see.

14:20.609 --> 14:22.444
What if this leaves a scar?

14:23.821 --> 14:27.575
I wouldn't have held back
if it weren't for you.

14:27.658 --> 14:28.492
I see.

14:30.077 --> 14:31.120
That's so cold.

14:58.939 --> 15:00.941
OFFICE BUILDING FIRE IN YEOUIDO, SEOUL

15:04.194 --> 15:05.446
Did you see it?

15:06.030 --> 15:06.947
What do you think?

15:07.031 --> 15:08.032
MASTER

15:08.115 --> 15:12.912
DID YOU SEE IT? WHAT DO YOU THINK?

15:12.995 --> 15:14.788
DON'T ACT ALONE FROM NOW ON.

15:17.082 --> 15:19.501
So why did you leave me out?

15:20.586 --> 15:22.254
I want to join in on the fun too.

15:26.091 --> 15:27.927
Oh, a job?

16:10.511 --> 16:13.013
A college friend? Were you close?

16:18.978 --> 16:20.604
SANG-WOO

16:25.192 --> 16:27.611
Hee-joo, it was great to see you today.

16:27.695 --> 16:30.280
I was reminded of old times,
so I looked this up. Remember?

16:51.468 --> 16:52.845
NURI DREAM CENTER

16:56.140 --> 17:00.686
For Crime Report: Season 2,
we'll focus on unsolved cases.

17:01.520 --> 17:05.482
Is there anything you haven't revealed yet
on your own channel?

17:06.442 --> 17:09.403
Sir, do you really think
he'll reveal it on our show?

17:12.156 --> 17:12.990
I do…

17:16.285 --> 17:17.119
have one.

17:20.289 --> 17:21.123
What is it?

17:23.167 --> 17:25.669
Instead of asking what it is,

17:25.753 --> 17:28.756
shouldn't you be asking
why I haven't revealed it yet?

17:29.339 --> 17:32.217
Yeah, what is it
and why haven't you revealed it?

17:39.558 --> 17:42.394
There's an orphanage
called Nuri Dream Center.

17:43.812 --> 17:44.897
And I grew up there.

17:50.569 --> 17:51.403
What?

17:52.905 --> 17:54.031
First time seeing an orphan?

17:54.698 --> 17:55.616
No.

17:58.118 --> 17:59.161
Please continue.

18:01.747 --> 18:02.581
So…

18:03.540 --> 18:08.337
about 20 years ago, in the town
where the orphanage was located,

18:10.881 --> 18:13.801
there was an enormous mansion
owned by a wealthy family.

18:44.081 --> 18:45.249
That's when I first met him.

18:46.125 --> 18:49.378
The young master from Seoul
came to visit the mansion.

18:54.007 --> 18:56.718
His room was filled
with all sorts of toys.

18:57.469 --> 19:01.390
We played there joyfully every day.

19:03.725 --> 19:04.560
Until the day…

19:08.147 --> 19:10.149
I saw something terrible there.

19:28.375 --> 19:29.751
What was it?

19:30.335 --> 19:31.336
What did you see?

19:33.755 --> 19:34.590
Well…

19:39.261 --> 19:40.095
Goodness!

19:42.306 --> 19:43.557
The meeting's over.

19:45.934 --> 19:47.102
I have plans for lunch.

19:48.145 --> 19:49.646
- What?
- Excuse me.

19:49.730 --> 19:50.564
What?

19:52.983 --> 19:54.818
Did he just leave like that?

19:54.902 --> 19:55.986
He just left?

19:57.112 --> 19:59.615
NURI DREAM CENTER

20:02.075 --> 20:04.369
NURI DREAM CENTER IS AN ORPHANAGE.

20:10.542 --> 20:12.252
SANG-WOO

20:12.336 --> 20:15.672
Let's eat lunch here at noon
this Saturday if you have time.

20:23.096 --> 20:25.432
A cup of refreshing tea
to soothe an upset stomach.

20:26.433 --> 20:28.310
- I'm on my way.
- Have a good day.

20:37.069 --> 20:38.695
How refreshing.

20:38.779 --> 20:42.783
The explosive device used is TATP,
a high-performance liquid explosive.

20:42.866 --> 20:46.036
Despite its simple manufacturing,
it has immense explosive power.

20:46.119 --> 20:49.915
Fortunately, the detonation device
wasn't fully activated in this incident.

20:49.998 --> 20:53.168
Aren't the main ingredients
acetone and hydrogen peroxide?

20:53.252 --> 20:56.338
That's right, so the police
are questioning nearby pharmacies.

20:59.383 --> 21:01.176
What about the voice modulation?

21:01.260 --> 21:02.219
Is it not done yet?

21:02.761 --> 21:05.097
It's impossible to analyze
with existing software.

21:05.180 --> 21:07.599
We're trying with a different version.
I apologize.

21:11.019 --> 21:12.396
No, I'm sorry.

21:12.479 --> 21:15.065
I'm asking for so much
over personal matters.

21:15.148 --> 21:16.817
No, I just…

21:18.026 --> 21:21.071
You entrusted me with this,
and I want to be of help.

21:21.655 --> 21:25.325
Also, if there's someone threatening you,
it's my job to figure out who.

21:38.672 --> 21:39.506
MATINÉE

21:47.222 --> 21:50.142
Sa-eon, I hope you have
a pleasant day today!

21:50.684 --> 21:52.436
And enjoy your lunch!

21:59.484 --> 22:00.986
The seafood is great here.

22:02.029 --> 22:03.363
Is white wine okay?

22:09.661 --> 22:11.538
Na You-ri, reservation for two.

22:11.621 --> 22:12.956
I'll show you to your table.

22:16.460 --> 22:18.712
Do you have a private room here?

22:18.795 --> 22:20.630
I'm afraid they're all full.

22:20.714 --> 22:23.050
I see. What do I do?

22:23.133 --> 22:24.968
A table in the open is uncomfortable.

22:25.927 --> 22:27.262
What? Hey!

22:29.181 --> 22:30.015
The interpreter!

22:30.682 --> 22:33.101
You had plans with the interpreter?

22:34.144 --> 22:36.021
Yes, we're friends from college.

22:36.104 --> 22:38.190
Really?

22:38.815 --> 22:41.651
I suddenly got plans to eat here too!

22:43.737 --> 22:45.363
Right this way.

22:45.447 --> 22:46.656
Okay.

22:47.866 --> 22:49.076
Right.

22:49.826 --> 22:50.911
By the way,

22:51.495 --> 22:54.414
when my guest arrives later,

22:54.498 --> 22:57.084
please try not to stare
too obviously, okay?

22:57.167 --> 22:59.336
It could make him uncomfortable.

23:00.629 --> 23:02.255
Well, enjoy your lunch.

23:07.260 --> 23:08.095
What was that?

23:09.971 --> 23:11.139
Is a celebrity coming?

23:17.687 --> 23:18.855
Do I look puffy today?

23:23.902 --> 23:25.028
Over here!

23:30.826 --> 23:31.660
Isn't that…

23:33.245 --> 23:35.747
What? What's he doing here?

23:35.831 --> 23:38.083
He won't act like he knows me, will he?

23:41.711 --> 23:42.879
Don't.

23:47.008 --> 23:51.012
- Please, don't.
- Interpreter Hong Hee-joo?

23:59.563 --> 24:01.356
There were no prints?

24:01.439 --> 24:03.567
We checked the explosives, but nothing.

24:03.650 --> 24:06.194
- What about local inquiries?
- We're still on it.

24:07.696 --> 24:10.991
But which high-ranking official
in the presidential office

24:11.074 --> 24:12.993
keeps requesting updates like this?

24:24.087 --> 24:24.963
Goodness!

24:25.046 --> 24:26.673
- Call 911!
- Someone call!

24:27.674 --> 24:29.176
- Call 911.
- Okay.

24:29.259 --> 24:30.719
- Evacuate everyone.
- Yes, sir.

24:30.802 --> 24:32.220
- Bring a fire extinguisher.
- Okay.

25:09.257 --> 25:11.343
Okay, okay.

25:11.426 --> 25:12.886
Damn it!

25:29.069 --> 25:31.738
Try this.
It's in season, so it'll be good.

25:37.035 --> 25:37.869
It's good.

25:38.536 --> 25:39.788
Good, right?

25:41.206 --> 25:42.249
Do you like it?

25:46.378 --> 25:51.174
Hee-joo and Sang-woo are college friends.

25:53.843 --> 25:55.929
It seems like you like seafood.

25:56.012 --> 25:57.264
Yes, I do.

26:02.602 --> 26:07.857
By the way, Sa-eon,
how do you know Hee-joo?

26:10.360 --> 26:13.738
She recently helped us out
with interpreting at the British Embassy.

26:14.572 --> 26:17.033
I was hoping to treat you
to a meal sometime.

26:17.117 --> 26:18.493
I'm glad we met like this.

26:19.119 --> 26:21.621
I'm sorry if I intruded.

26:21.705 --> 26:23.039
No, it's fine.

26:23.123 --> 26:27.460
Thanks to Hee-joo, I get to have lunch
with you, so it's an honor.

26:29.671 --> 26:30.505
A glass of wine?

26:33.633 --> 26:35.468
I don't day drink.

26:37.262 --> 26:38.096
Right.

26:48.898 --> 26:50.400
Are you okay?

26:50.900 --> 26:52.277
We can go if you're uncomfortable.

26:53.069 --> 26:54.154
I'm okay.

26:57.949 --> 26:59.409
You're good at sign language.

26:59.492 --> 27:00.452
Yes, I am.

27:00.535 --> 27:02.120
- Are you an interpreter?
- No.

27:02.203 --> 27:03.330
Then what do you do?

27:12.130 --> 27:13.048
Mr. Ji is…

27:13.131 --> 27:14.591
Mr. Ji? What does he do?

27:14.674 --> 27:15.592
- He's a--
- A doctor.

27:17.302 --> 27:19.846
- What department?
- Department of Psychiatry.

27:26.436 --> 27:27.395
Are you married?

27:28.063 --> 27:29.230
Are you interested in me?

27:29.314 --> 27:30.482
Yes.

27:34.235 --> 27:35.153
Are you okay?

27:40.075 --> 27:41.159
I have to use the restroom.

27:42.118 --> 27:43.495
Okay, go ahead.

28:03.723 --> 28:05.225
Excuse me for a moment.

28:11.272 --> 28:12.649
What an interesting person.

28:14.359 --> 28:16.569
I must be his type.

28:17.153 --> 28:18.154
Of course not!

28:19.155 --> 28:20.782
He's a married man.

28:21.408 --> 28:22.450
You caught him?

28:22.534 --> 28:24.327
Yes, he was apprehended at the scene.

28:24.411 --> 28:27.539
They searched his residence
and found plenty of homemade bombs.

28:27.622 --> 28:28.706
It's not him.

28:29.332 --> 28:31.543
- I think it's the neighborhood arsonist.
- Pardon?

28:31.626 --> 28:33.795
If he was watching the fire at the scene,

28:33.878 --> 28:36.840
he's likely a pyromaniac
who gets a thrill from it.

28:36.923 --> 28:40.510
So he's most likely the serial arsonist.

28:41.094 --> 28:42.637
Is he being interrogated now?

28:42.720 --> 28:43.555
Yes.

28:45.473 --> 28:47.642
Man, you've got guts.

28:47.726 --> 28:49.269
Set fire two days in a row?

28:49.352 --> 28:50.729
I didn't do it yesterday.

28:50.812 --> 28:52.313
You punk.

28:53.106 --> 28:55.233
This is insane. I swear.

28:55.316 --> 28:58.069
Why are you blaming me
and not catching that guy?

28:58.153 --> 29:01.865
That bastard has no ethics.
How dare he do that in my turf?

29:01.948 --> 29:03.992
Does that young brat
have nothing better to do?

29:04.075 --> 29:05.243
"Young brat"?

29:07.203 --> 29:09.414
Okay. I'm on my way now.

29:25.263 --> 29:27.515
Why did you come here? How did you know?

29:27.599 --> 29:29.934
You said you'd check for hacking.
Were you spying on me?

29:30.018 --> 29:30.852
Why?

29:31.686 --> 29:33.188
Are you hiding something from me?

29:37.400 --> 29:38.818
What are you saying?

29:38.902 --> 29:41.821
Do you suspect me and Sang-woo?

29:42.822 --> 29:43.823
"Suspect"?

29:44.949 --> 29:45.825
About what?

29:47.535 --> 29:50.371
Whatever it is.
Sang-woo isn't that type of person. So--

29:52.040 --> 29:54.709
Do you know him that well?

29:55.460 --> 29:56.377
A college friend?

29:57.629 --> 29:59.297
You said he was a good person.

30:00.465 --> 30:01.466
I don't know.

30:02.217 --> 30:03.384
I don't care about that.

30:04.219 --> 30:07.889
To me, he's just some loser
who suddenly showed up around you.

30:07.972 --> 30:08.890
Also…

30:10.683 --> 30:12.310
if you know him so well,

30:13.728 --> 30:14.646
what about me?

30:15.438 --> 30:16.940
How much do you know about me?

30:17.482 --> 30:18.775
Haven't we known each other

30:19.984 --> 30:21.236
for about 20 years now?

30:29.452 --> 30:30.453
Hong Hee-joo.

30:32.413 --> 30:33.248
Tell me.

30:34.707 --> 30:35.792
Do you know me well?

30:36.751 --> 30:38.586
I suddenly had this thought.

30:39.879 --> 30:41.881
I thought I knew you too.

30:43.049 --> 30:44.342
But I don't think…

30:46.052 --> 30:48.096
I knew you all that well after all.

31:02.735 --> 31:03.736
DIRECTOR HAN JIN-E

31:03.820 --> 31:07.115
I need to talk to you. Come to the center.

31:12.036 --> 31:14.664
Excuse me, I have to go now.

31:14.747 --> 31:16.833
- I'll pay.
- No, I'll get it.

31:16.916 --> 31:18.418
Can I get your business card?

31:21.629 --> 31:22.463
Sure.

31:23.339 --> 31:27.135
Come if you ever need counseling
or feel any discomfort.

31:29.304 --> 31:31.681
BLISS CARE CLINIC

31:33.057 --> 31:34.350
JI SANG-WOO

31:39.022 --> 31:40.982
- I'll see you again.
- Okay, Sa-eon.

31:42.358 --> 31:43.234
Thanks for lunch!

31:52.035 --> 31:54.996
Sorry, but the center called me.
I have to go.

31:55.079 --> 31:56.414
Okay. You should go.

32:06.257 --> 32:09.344
Good luck, Hong Hee-joo!
You can do it, Hong Hee-joo!

32:09.427 --> 32:11.346
You got this, Hong Hee-joo!

32:11.429 --> 32:13.348
2024 PRESIDENTIAL
SIGN LANGUAGE INT. HIRING

32:13.431 --> 32:14.265
I knew it.

32:14.766 --> 32:16.184
I knew you'd like it.

32:16.935 --> 32:18.311
I don't like it.

32:18.853 --> 32:19.896
Why not?

32:20.563 --> 32:24.400
I know you've practiced signing
with Paik Sa-eon's videos every day.

32:24.484 --> 32:27.487
Are you nervous about living out
your fangirl dreams?

32:28.780 --> 32:31.074
Is it better after a divorce?

32:32.075 --> 32:32.909
What? Divorce?

32:33.618 --> 32:35.328
Why? Why do you ask?

32:35.912 --> 32:37.246
Is your husband having an affair?

32:38.998 --> 32:42.293
I think my husband wishes I were dead.

32:42.377 --> 32:43.378
What?

32:45.296 --> 32:46.965
My goodness. You had me there.

32:49.884 --> 32:50.802
Hee-joo.

32:51.552 --> 32:55.014
Did he tell you he wishes you were dead?

32:55.098 --> 32:56.599
That means

32:57.266 --> 33:02.313
he still really, really loves you deeply.

33:06.859 --> 33:07.694
Hey.

33:08.361 --> 33:12.407
When a couple truly separates,
they don't engage in heated arguments

33:12.490 --> 33:14.993
or say things like,
"I wish you were dead."

33:16.452 --> 33:19.872
They become indifferent
and walk back and forth saying,

33:19.956 --> 33:23.501
"Are you not dead yet?"

33:27.839 --> 33:30.925
Call me when there's a corpse.

33:36.139 --> 33:37.515
It's a good reason…

33:39.100 --> 33:39.976
for divorce.

33:45.356 --> 33:46.649
You were right.

33:46.733 --> 33:48.943
The man caught earlier was the arsonist.

33:49.527 --> 33:53.990
But there was a small fire in the area
that wasn't reported to the police.

34:01.539 --> 34:03.499
The explosion killed some stray cats.

34:03.583 --> 34:04.834
Damn it.

34:22.101 --> 34:24.270
You think it was done as a test?

34:25.021 --> 34:26.022
Yes.

34:26.522 --> 34:29.901
According to the arsonist, those were
the only two things he didn't do.

34:29.984 --> 34:32.320
The park and our office building.

34:33.654 --> 34:38.034
If he did that to animals,
he could have psychopathic tendencies.

34:39.243 --> 34:41.537
How will you handle the call tonight?

34:43.706 --> 34:46.667
We threw the bait,
so let's see how he reacts.

34:47.418 --> 34:50.088
I've reset the equipment
in the new office.

34:51.380 --> 34:52.215
Okay.

34:53.466 --> 34:56.177
Also, look into this person.

34:58.179 --> 34:59.639
Ji Sang-woo?

35:02.558 --> 35:03.392
Do you know him?

35:04.268 --> 35:05.895
Hello, Paradisers.

35:05.978 --> 35:07.480
EARTHLY PARADISE

35:07.563 --> 35:10.274
I'll start today's broadcast
with a cup of tea.

35:11.359 --> 35:13.778
- When you see a psychiatrist…
- "Paradisers"? What?

35:13.861 --> 35:16.447
It's a play on words with his name.

35:16.531 --> 35:19.117
That's why his channel is called
"Earthly Paradise."

35:19.200 --> 35:21.244
So he calls his viewers "Paradisers."

35:21.327 --> 35:23.830
- Jeez.
- He has over 200,000 subscribers.

35:23.913 --> 35:26.999
He mainly covers unsolved mystery cases
and criminal psychology.

35:27.083 --> 35:29.043
- He's very popular among women.
- Why?

35:29.127 --> 35:32.964
- Excuse me?
- Why is he popular among women?

35:34.924 --> 35:35.925
I think…

35:37.135 --> 35:38.302
it's his physique.

35:39.428 --> 35:40.263
His physique?

35:45.518 --> 35:47.311
He's serious about working out.

35:47.395 --> 35:49.939
Especially the shoulder deltoids.
They're a work of art.

36:00.950 --> 36:03.911
It seems this doctor
has a lot of free time.

36:05.121 --> 36:06.747
And it seems, Mr. Park,

36:08.332 --> 36:09.542
you do too.

36:12.628 --> 36:15.590
What should I look for?
Do you have specific concerns?

36:16.215 --> 36:19.468
It won't be too much to suspect anyone
who comes into view.

36:19.552 --> 36:21.095
Find everything you can on him.

36:22.305 --> 36:23.139
Yes, sir.

36:34.358 --> 36:37.069
If you're seriously thinking
about getting a divorce,

36:37.153 --> 36:39.030
you have to get this job.

36:39.113 --> 36:41.282
You think it's easy for women
to earn a living alone?

36:41.365 --> 36:45.119
Experience as a sign language interpreter
at the presidential office

36:45.703 --> 36:47.455
ensures you can get a job anywhere.

36:56.839 --> 36:58.841
The car's ready.

37:41.342 --> 37:42.843
YOU'RE LISTENING TO 99.4 MHZ

37:42.927 --> 37:46.138
You just listened to the song
requested by Song Hyun-joo.

37:46.222 --> 37:52.186
Next, we have a song
requested by user 406-000-1290.

37:52.270 --> 37:54.313
"Call Me Now" by Colin Sof.

38:43.362 --> 38:45.990
Are you okay? I thought you had come out.

39:15.227 --> 39:16.562
Does he want me to call?

39:18.439 --> 39:21.817
Does he know that I have this phone?

39:27.573 --> 39:28.908
Already?

39:34.997 --> 39:36.248
Where are you going?

39:38.542 --> 39:41.545
Here. There were no traces of hacking.

39:42.254 --> 39:43.506
I asked where you were going.

39:48.886 --> 39:50.846
- The convenience store.
- For what?

39:56.519 --> 39:57.686
Beer and ice cream.

40:00.398 --> 40:01.315
Anything else?

40:41.522 --> 40:45.109
How does it feel
to have messed up so badly, 406?

40:45.192 --> 40:46.861
So why did you drag your feet?

40:46.944 --> 40:49.029
It's your fault
for taking my threat lightly.

40:49.613 --> 40:51.365
Man, let's end this.

40:51.449 --> 40:52.783
What will it be? Decide.

40:52.867 --> 40:54.743
I want to ask you something first.

40:55.703 --> 40:59.623
What do you gain if I leave Hong Hee-joo?

41:02.042 --> 41:03.335
What do I gain?

41:04.795 --> 41:08.299
What 406 gains from this?

41:13.971 --> 41:17.183
What are you trying to achieve
by getting me to divorce Hong Hee-joo?

41:17.266 --> 41:18.267
What do you mean?

41:19.018 --> 41:21.187
It's not like you married her for love.

41:21.270 --> 41:22.688
You don't even love her now.

41:22.771 --> 41:26.400
If it's going to be like that,
just leave her.

41:33.991 --> 41:34.825
Hello?

41:35.534 --> 41:38.287
I guess you have no idea
how that sounds to me.

41:40.206 --> 41:41.540
It feels like

41:42.291 --> 41:44.877
your threats are
for someone else's benefit.

41:46.170 --> 41:49.507
What's your relationship
with Hong Hee-joo?

41:54.094 --> 41:55.554
Listen carefully, 406.

41:56.347 --> 41:59.808
I will never give you what you want.

42:00.851 --> 42:03.604
You're a crazy man
resorting to kidnapping, extortion,

42:03.687 --> 42:05.231
and even bomb threats now.

42:05.314 --> 42:07.483
Do you think I'd give Hee-joo to you?

42:08.776 --> 42:10.444
I have no intention

42:11.487 --> 42:12.738
of giving her up.

42:12.821 --> 42:14.615
Wait, why won't you give her up--

42:14.698 --> 42:17.409
I'm sorry. Let's end the call here
for today.

42:17.493 --> 42:20.579
Hee-joo's waiting for something.

42:23.207 --> 42:25.709
Hello?

42:29.838 --> 42:31.131
What on earth…

42:34.426 --> 42:36.845
What's he thinking?

42:43.394 --> 42:45.396
I won't divorce you.

42:48.357 --> 42:51.902
I'm saying this
just in case someone misleads you.

42:53.028 --> 42:54.405
There's no divorce for me.

42:54.488 --> 42:56.323
Whether it's a scandal or rumor,

42:56.407 --> 42:59.326
I won't tolerate my name
being dragged through the mud.

43:04.123 --> 43:05.249
That's why.

43:13.632 --> 43:14.800
Everything you do…

43:21.348 --> 43:22.725
is clumsy.

43:29.231 --> 43:31.108
Did the official document
reach the center?

43:31.942 --> 43:34.903
You're going to have to give it your all
to stand beside me.

43:49.501 --> 43:51.503
Why do you want me by your side?

43:57.551 --> 43:59.762
If I become the interpreter
at the presidential office,

43:59.845 --> 44:01.347
you think you can handle it?

44:01.430 --> 44:04.767
The entire world will know
my name and face.

44:05.434 --> 44:07.811
You seem pretty confident, don't you?

44:09.980 --> 44:13.233
I can assure you,
there's no one better than me.

44:14.777 --> 44:18.322
What unfounded confidence is that?
You're not that experienced.

44:20.240 --> 44:23.786
Experience isn't everything.
I can tell by a person's expression.

44:23.869 --> 44:26.830
I know what you're going to say
and what you're thinking.

44:30.918 --> 44:31.919
Really?

44:32.002 --> 44:33.504
Then tell me.

44:35.798 --> 44:37.383
What am I thinking now?

44:40.010 --> 44:42.971
The guy who kidnapped you and threw
a bomb in my office knows a lot,

44:43.555 --> 44:45.015
as I mentioned, right?

44:46.558 --> 44:47.393
Yes.

44:48.394 --> 44:50.854
It's true we may be better off
as strangers,

44:51.438 --> 44:52.773
but I hate that.

44:54.024 --> 44:55.984
I don't like that what he said is true.

44:57.111 --> 44:58.237
I want to tell him,

44:58.862 --> 45:01.657
"No, you're wrong."

45:02.658 --> 45:04.410
"What do you know about us?"

45:06.662 --> 45:07.788
That's what I'll do.

45:23.011 --> 45:23.846
Lie down.

45:27.474 --> 45:28.475
Come and lie down.

45:29.560 --> 45:31.019
I won't bite.

45:38.360 --> 45:39.528
Do whatever you want.

45:51.498 --> 45:54.460
What? Are you afraid I'll jump you?

45:56.503 --> 45:57.421
Dream on.

45:58.172 --> 46:00.340
If I were going to,
I'd have done it already.

46:00.424 --> 46:02.050
We've been together for years.

46:06.430 --> 46:07.264
Wait.

46:08.223 --> 46:09.892
Are you scared you might jump me?

46:10.767 --> 46:13.395
Yeah, I could see that happening.

46:15.439 --> 46:17.316
Don't come if you can't resist.

46:42.216 --> 46:43.425
Don't turn your back.

46:44.134 --> 46:45.886
It's rude to the person beside you.

46:58.357 --> 47:01.026
He knew where my office was,

47:03.445 --> 47:05.739
so the house probably isn't safe either.

47:07.157 --> 47:08.158
But for tonight…

47:10.494 --> 47:11.745
sleep without worrying.

47:18.418 --> 47:20.837
And whatever happened
the day you were kidnapped…

47:24.174 --> 47:25.968
just think of it as a bad dream.

47:35.686 --> 47:37.354
What you heard then, too.

47:40.649 --> 47:44.319
That you said to call
when there's a corpse?

47:44.403 --> 47:45.404
Forget it all.

47:47.573 --> 47:48.991
Don't read too much into it.

49:12.199 --> 49:13.283
What do I do?

49:16.328 --> 49:18.830
What should I do?

49:32.010 --> 49:33.345
Mom?

49:39.976 --> 49:40.811
Why?

49:41.895 --> 49:43.230
Why did you survive?

49:44.439 --> 49:47.192
Why are you unscathed?
You should've been hurt too!

49:51.738 --> 49:54.408
Be quiet. Don't make a sound.

49:55.325 --> 49:58.245
His biological daughter's deaf,
and his only son is dead.

49:58.662 --> 50:01.039
But you're unscathed,
and if you upset the chairman,

50:01.123 --> 50:02.582
we'll get kicked out!

50:07.879 --> 50:09.214
Yes, Hee-joo.

50:11.091 --> 50:12.676
Don't say a word.

50:13.635 --> 50:14.469
Hee-joo,

50:15.262 --> 50:16.596
you're so shocked

50:17.222 --> 50:19.599
that you can't speak, okay?

50:20.267 --> 50:22.269
Mom, that hurts.

50:22.853 --> 50:23.937
Shut your mouth!

50:24.020 --> 50:25.814
You can't sacrifice your voice?

50:25.897 --> 50:29.401
Not every life holds
the same value, Hee-joo.

50:30.318 --> 50:31.153
We…

50:32.237 --> 50:35.031
We can only stay
if the chairman feels sorry for us.

50:35.115 --> 50:36.283
Do you understand?

50:43.248 --> 50:45.876
How long do I have to not speak?

50:48.420 --> 50:50.297
Until you turn into bubbles.

50:52.716 --> 50:56.219
You're the Little Mermaid now.

51:34.633 --> 51:35.842
Crap!

51:41.097 --> 51:41.932
Come on!

51:44.976 --> 51:45.811
Hey!

51:47.020 --> 51:47.896
What was that?

51:51.316 --> 51:52.150
I almost forgot.

51:53.568 --> 51:54.986
What happened with him?

51:55.946 --> 51:56.947
Who?

51:57.614 --> 52:01.910
You know, the guy who got a naked picture
of his wife from some crazy man.

52:02.994 --> 52:03.870
Was it an affair?

52:05.413 --> 52:07.624
- I don't know.
- It's definitely an affair.

52:08.375 --> 52:10.168
He'd know if he checked his wife.

52:11.169 --> 52:12.254
He didn't.

52:13.880 --> 52:14.714
Why not?

52:18.176 --> 52:19.594
To try and get evidence?

52:21.221 --> 52:22.639
He might not want to.

52:23.306 --> 52:24.182
What?

52:33.942 --> 52:35.902
To find out for himself.

52:40.282 --> 52:41.157
He's a pervert.

52:43.577 --> 52:47.163
Normal people would've lost it
and dug right in for the truth.

52:47.247 --> 52:48.999
"Who are you sleeping with?"

52:53.003 --> 52:55.213
But he can't even check for himself.

52:56.423 --> 52:57.382
What do you think?

52:59.509 --> 53:00.719
It's true love.

53:02.596 --> 53:04.306
He loves his wife.

53:05.015 --> 53:06.266
He's got to be a pervert.

53:09.519 --> 53:13.315
The weather's cooled down,
so it's bearable now.

53:14.733 --> 53:15.984
Are you okay?

53:17.903 --> 53:19.905
Goodness. Where's my head at?

53:19.988 --> 53:23.783
I didn't bring a blanket.
I'll be right back, okay?

54:33.061 --> 54:37.273
Let's have a moment of silence to honor
our patriotic martyrs and fallen heroes.

54:37.357 --> 54:38.900
Bow for a moment of silence.

55:47.427 --> 55:50.430
DAD

55:56.436 --> 55:57.771
A video call?

56:00.732 --> 56:01.983
Dad?

56:03.151 --> 56:05.945
Sis!

56:08.823 --> 56:09.824
How have you been?

56:10.992 --> 56:11.826
Where's my phone?

56:12.911 --> 56:14.412
Are you using it well?

56:18.124 --> 56:19.834
Yeah, I know.

56:19.918 --> 56:22.587
I know you took it.

56:23.171 --> 56:24.339
You did well yesterday.

56:24.422 --> 56:25.423
Sis, I like you.

56:26.091 --> 56:27.967
You're quick to catch on.

56:28.051 --> 56:29.552
Wait.

56:33.389 --> 56:35.475
What about my dad?

56:38.645 --> 56:41.481
Starting now, I'll ask you questions,

56:42.398 --> 56:43.483
and you'll answer.

56:44.275 --> 56:45.110
Sis.

56:47.195 --> 56:48.780
Using that phone

56:49.906 --> 56:53.660
means you're threatening
Paik Sa-eon, right?

56:53.743 --> 56:54.702
But for what?

56:55.286 --> 56:56.121
Well?

56:57.247 --> 56:58.998
What are you asking for?

57:00.500 --> 57:01.501
Answer me.

57:02.585 --> 57:04.462
If not, I'm coming for that phone…

57:07.382 --> 57:08.383
right now.

57:11.553 --> 57:12.428
A divorce.

57:13.096 --> 57:13.930
What?

57:21.146 --> 57:22.397
That's right!

57:23.606 --> 57:26.234
Sis, that night…

57:26.317 --> 57:27.902
I'd be pissed too.

57:30.363 --> 57:33.241
I swear, Paik Sa-eon is a total asshole.

57:34.534 --> 57:36.035
So, Sis?

57:37.203 --> 57:38.204
Call him.

57:38.872 --> 57:40.039
Keep calling him.

57:40.123 --> 57:41.207
Sis,

57:42.292 --> 57:45.128
I like you. Do you know why?

57:46.504 --> 57:48.590
Because you have the same goal as us.

57:50.008 --> 57:51.092
So…

57:51.968 --> 57:53.887
you can

57:55.430 --> 57:56.514
keep the phone.

57:57.765 --> 57:58.892
But…

57:59.517 --> 58:00.852
you have to promise me.

58:07.692 --> 58:09.319
No backing out…

58:11.404 --> 58:12.572
in the middle.

58:13.907 --> 58:15.492
You started this,

58:16.951 --> 58:18.578
so you see it through.

58:18.661 --> 58:19.829
Got it?

58:19.913 --> 58:23.041
Sis!

58:26.920 --> 58:29.881
Hello? Dad!

58:39.390 --> 58:40.225
Let's go.

59:06.209 --> 59:07.710
I hope he'll be okay.

59:08.628 --> 59:09.837
Let's keep in touch.

59:09.921 --> 59:11.005
Of course.

59:11.756 --> 59:12.715
Hee-joo!

59:12.799 --> 59:14.968
She's his daughter. Na Jin-cheol's… What?

59:20.557 --> 59:23.101
Fortunately, he wasn't hurt.

59:23.184 --> 59:25.270
He's sedated and asleep.

59:25.353 --> 59:28.481
I'm so sorry.
I stepped away for just a moment.

59:28.565 --> 59:29.774
He suddenly disappeared.

59:31.150 --> 59:34.112
When the caregiver found your father,
he was alone.

59:35.321 --> 59:36.781
And these were with him.

59:40.034 --> 59:44.372
But since your father is unharmed,
they could belong to someone else.

59:44.455 --> 59:47.458
For now, we need to investigate it.

59:47.542 --> 59:51.379
Yes, will you come with us
to file a report?

59:53.214 --> 59:54.591
Are you awake?

01:00:04.517 --> 01:00:05.852
Call.

01:00:11.357 --> 01:00:12.609
Call.

01:00:17.488 --> 01:00:19.866
Call him.

01:00:22.118 --> 01:00:24.245
Sis.

01:00:29.167 --> 01:00:30.710
Goodness!

01:00:30.793 --> 01:00:32.670
Are you okay?

01:00:36.799 --> 01:00:38.468
Call him.

01:00:41.262 --> 01:00:43.598
Sis.

01:01:08.539 --> 01:01:09.666
- What's that?
- What?

01:01:09.749 --> 01:01:10.750
I'll do it.

01:01:11.501 --> 01:01:12.794
What's wrong with this?

01:01:12.877 --> 01:01:14.921
What's wrong with this thing?

01:01:18.841 --> 01:01:19.676
What's wrong?

01:01:24.305 --> 01:01:27.141
What's going on with that now?
What's happening?

01:01:32.230 --> 01:01:33.898
What?

01:01:35.858 --> 01:01:37.068
You have to promise me.

01:01:37.652 --> 01:01:39.904
No backing out in the middle.

01:01:40.488 --> 01:01:42.156
You started this,

01:01:42.907 --> 01:01:44.867
so you see it through.

01:01:44.951 --> 01:01:45.952
Got it?

01:01:46.035 --> 01:01:48.705
Sis!

01:01:51.791 --> 01:01:53.918
Call him.

01:01:55.378 --> 01:01:58.089
Sis.

01:02:04.387 --> 01:02:05.388
What is it?

01:02:06.139 --> 01:02:06.973
What's wrong?

01:02:08.182 --> 01:02:09.767
Are you feeling sick?

01:02:23.448 --> 01:02:24.323
Oh, dear.

01:02:25.450 --> 01:02:26.284
Are you okay?

01:02:35.126 --> 01:02:36.961
What was I expecting?

01:02:37.920 --> 01:02:39.046
I was such a fool.

01:02:45.219 --> 01:02:46.220
Has my life

01:02:47.555 --> 01:02:49.223
ever been easy?

01:02:53.144 --> 01:02:56.105
Why do I still have to bring
things like this

01:02:56.189 --> 01:02:58.065
and teach you everything?

01:03:02.987 --> 01:03:05.823
I can't do anything.

01:03:07.492 --> 01:03:10.912
No one in this world is on my side.

01:03:18.461 --> 01:03:19.378
What?

01:03:21.172 --> 01:03:23.925
What is that?

01:03:27.595 --> 01:03:30.723
What? Why are they coming towards us?

01:03:31.474 --> 01:03:33.392
- Did we do something wrong?
- No way!

01:03:33.476 --> 01:03:34.936
We didn't do anything.

01:04:28.781 --> 01:04:29.615
Hello!

01:04:33.286 --> 01:04:35.705
Hello. Thank you for your hard work.

01:04:42.795 --> 01:04:44.964
You may leave now.

01:04:45.047 --> 01:04:46.215
Pardon?

01:04:46.299 --> 01:04:48.801
I'll come to the station
to file the report.

01:04:48.885 --> 01:04:52.471
I'm sorry,
but what's your relationship with her?

01:04:55.141 --> 01:04:56.309
We're family.

01:04:56.392 --> 01:04:57.560
Excuse me?

01:05:08.988 --> 01:05:10.072
She is…

01:05:11.782 --> 01:05:12.950
my wife.

01:06:01.999 --> 01:06:04.919
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

01:06:05.002 --> 01:06:06.629
I can't do this anymore.

01:06:07.380 --> 01:06:10.007
- Let's go!
- To the president's office!

01:06:10.091 --> 01:06:12.593
It's your chance to try
with your name on the line.

01:06:12.677 --> 01:06:14.512
You should start thinking about

01:06:14.595 --> 01:06:17.390
how you're going to handle
the aftermath if I get the job.

01:06:17.473 --> 01:06:20.226
Finally, I want to test you on something.

01:06:20.935 --> 01:06:23.020
Can you not speak at all?

01:06:23.104 --> 01:06:25.064
You know what day it is today, right?

01:06:25.147 --> 01:06:26.315
Do you know or not

01:06:27.274 --> 01:06:29.068
that my sister is back?

01:06:29.944 --> 01:06:32.154
Tell me if you're hiding anything.

01:06:32.238 --> 01:06:33.114
Hong Hee-joo…

01:06:35.157 --> 01:06:36.325
can make sounds.

01:06:41.247 --> 01:06:43.249
Subtitle translation by: Sue Mounce
